cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "State of ATS 2026: employer-to-applicant-tracking-system attribution"
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
abstract: >-
  A selected sample of 738 employers with recorded ATS attributions. On
  2026-11-09, 436 rows were re-verified with live evidence (434 confirmed and
  2 vendor changes), up from 421 in the 2026-10-09 pass: 22 rows were newly
  proven live and 7 could not be re-proven. 302 rows are labeled not
  re-verified in Nov 2026; their earlier vendor, host, method, and date are
  kept and are not treated as wrong. Shares describe the re-verified subset
  only. That subset skews toward vendors with public job APIs and is not an
  estimate of market share. Observed hosts do not establish private screening
  configurations.
type: dataset
license: MIT
